# Reviewer Caveat Blocker Policy (P1)

**Status:** P1-candidate

## Policy
Reviewer-Verifier closure-critical caveats are BLOCKING. Phase cannot close with unmet floors, missing modules, endpoint gaps, or contamination.

## Blocking Categories
- endpointDeficit, moduleDeficit, testDeficit, floorMiss
- qualityGap, contaminationDetected, hiddenFallbackDetected, scopeViolationDetected

## Non-Blocking
- codeStyleVariance, documentationFormatting, minorRedundancy, nonCriticalOptimization

## Escape
Only via: User explicit waiver OR builder repair + Reviewer-Verifier re-check.
No silent pass. No caveat-to-warning downgrade.
